###  https://cfaa.eus/ontology/industrial#CoolingSystem
ind:CoolingSystem rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf ind:Subsystem ;
                  rdfs:label "CoolingSystem"@en ,
                             "Sistema de refrigeración"@es .


